    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/294073164eb80e53d0cf1be4f5dc8b9d.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Welcome to the world of Whiffle Blasters, a Twin-Stick Arena Shooter where you only get one shot! If you miss your shot, you better be prepared to slap the competition.<br><br>Balls tend to show up right when you need them, but you will have to fight for each one.  <br>Try to keep track of who shot their ball, and who has been slapped.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a6bc4afb3ddd9ffefb3df7976a39b378.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a6bc4afb3ddd9ffefb3df7976a39b378.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/33a8800f5730bba1d81c03cc4db326de.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>A shot from the blaster is a one-hit KO, but don\u2019t forget you can knock someone out by slapping them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a87b261895e8c3ab79014b202f4c51fb.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a87b261895e8c3ab79014b202f4c51fb.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/0771b5f3a183d15f9d6dd8ad226d82fe.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>A few well timed slaps can be just as effective as a shot!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember: It takes 3 slaps to knock someone out, just like in real life! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/73355cecd7561dbd9928f7a0ac981f9b.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/73355cecd7561dbd9928f7a0ac981f9b.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/3ff836836366deb584a1fbd0e14d58a3.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Balls tend to ricochet like crazy so watch those angles and bring your protractor! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/ec7b9ed894da9b77f50607fff70b6792.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/ec7b9ed894da9b77f50607fff70b6792.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/b702c559cfdeae499dd5101dc6661913.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Did someone say cosmetics? Oh yea, we did.  <br>Win matches to earn XP, level up, and unlock cosmetic items to show off online!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/3812437b48f3d964db970dfc19e2389d.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/3812437b48f3d964db970dfc19e2389d.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/8035b21a7cb88d1fc13ed505a8dd38a5.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Play with up to 4 people online or locally!  <br>Whether your friends are across the globe or right next to you, party up and slap the jeeeez right out of them.... in the game. Just in the game. Plz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/4d805c4f63be05aeb52b7d0c51e8d3f2.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/4d805c4f63be05aeb52b7d0c51e8d3f2.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/294073164eb80e53d0cf1be4f5dc8b9d.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Welcome to the world of Whiffle Blasters, a Twin-Stick Arena Shooter where you only get one shot! If you miss your shot, you better be prepared to slap the competition.<br><br>Balls tend to show up right when you need them, but you will have to fight for each one.  <br>Try to keep track of who shot their ball, and who has been slapped.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a6bc4afb3ddd9ffefb3df7976a39b378.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a6bc4afb3ddd9ffefb3df7976a39b378.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/33a8800f5730bba1d81c03cc4db326de.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>A shot from the blaster is a one-hit KO, but don\u2019t forget you can knock someone out by slapping them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a87b261895e8c3ab79014b202f4c51fb.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/a87b261895e8c3ab79014b202f4c51fb.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/0771b5f3a183d15f9d6dd8ad226d82fe.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>A few well timed slaps can be just as effective as a shot!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember: It takes 3 slaps to knock someone out, just like in real life! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/73355cecd7561dbd9928f7a0ac981f9b.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/73355cecd7561dbd9928f7a0ac981f9b.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/3ff836836366deb584a1fbd0e14d58a3.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Balls tend to ricochet like crazy so watch those angles and bring your protractor! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/ec7b9ed894da9b77f50607fff70b6792.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/ec7b9ed894da9b77f50607fff70b6792.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/b702c559cfdeae499dd5101dc6661913.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Did someone say cosmetics? Oh yea, we did.  <br>Win matches to earn XP, level up, and unlock cosmetic items to show off online!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/3812437b48f3d964db970dfc19e2389d.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/3812437b48f3d964db970dfc19e2389d.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/8035b21a7cb88d1fc13ed505a8dd38a5.webp?t=1735590058\" /></div>Play with up to 4 people online or locally!  <br>Whether your friends are across the globe or right next to you, party up and slap the jeeeez right out of them.... in the game. Just in the game. Plz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/4d805c4f63be05aeb52b7d0c51e8d3f2.poster.avif?t=1735590058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1035570/extras/4d805c4f63be05aeb52b7d0c51e8d3f2.webm?t=1735590058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
